  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Scaffolds a TypeScript Slack Bolt app in Socket Mode from a 5-question interview. Generates the Slack app manifest with the right scopes and events, a Bolt starter with handler stubs, and a SETUP.md containing the exact dashboard navigation for retrieving tokens plus a copy-paste workspace-admin request.",
